{
  "file": "module3",
  "page": 112,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        68.93421936035156,
        246.438720703125,
        85.31422424316406
      ],
      "text": "Cost–effectiveness analysis",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Md",
      "size": 14.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        95.56519317626953,
        340.1640625,
        108.71018981933594
      ],
      "text": "This section answers the following additional question:",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        119.72309875488281,
        527.3364868164062,
        132.63710021972656
      ],
      "text": "What is the comparative cost, affordability and cost–effectiveness of implementation of",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Bd",
      "size": 10.998449325561523,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        135.2230987548828,
        348.54730224609375,
        148.13710021972656
      ],
      "text": "high complexity reverse hybridization-based NAATs?",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Bd",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        159.0731201171875,
        526.6390380859375,
        172.21812438964844
      ],
      "text": "A systematic review was carried out, focusing on economic evaluations of high complexity",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        174.5731201171875,
        526.84912109375,
        187.71812438964844
      ],
      "text": "reverse hybridization-based NAATs. Four online databases (Embase, Medline, Web of",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        190.0731201171875,
        526.9810180664062,
        203.21812438964844
      ],
      "text": "Science and Scopus) were searched for new studies published from 1 January 2010 through",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        205.5731201171875,
        527.0264892578125,
        218.71812438964844
      ],
      "text": "17 September 2020. The citations of all eligible articles, guidelines and reviews were reviewed",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.999350547790527,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        221.0731201171875,
        526.9480590820312,
        234.21812438964844
      ],
      "text": "for additional studies. The experts and test manufacturers were also contacted to identify any",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        236.5731201171875,
        224.76539611816406,
        249.71812438964844
      ],
      "text": "additional unpublished studies.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        260.5770263671875,
        526.7540283203125,
        273.7220458984375
      ],
      "text": "The objective of the review was to summarize current economic evidence and further understand",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.94486141204834,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        276.0770263671875,
        524.583251953125,
        289.2220458984375
      ],
      "text": "the costs, cost–effectiveness and affordability of high complexity reverse hybridization-",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        291.5770263671875,
        138.5489044189453,
        304.7220458984375
      ],
      "text": "based NAATs.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        315.5809326171875,
        526.7945556640625,
        328.7259521484375
      ],
      "text": "No published studies were identified assessing costs or cost–effectiveness using the commercially",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.94486141204834,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        331.0810241699219,
        526.9701538085938,
        344.2260437011719
      ],
      "text": "available high complexity hybridization-based NAAT (Genoscholar PZA-TB II, Nipro Japan).",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        346.5810241699219,
        527.0811157226562,
        359.7260437011719
      ],
      "text": "Indirect evidence was available from several sources. Four studies examining other commercially",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.94486141204834,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        362.0810241699219,
        487.8370361328125,
        375.2260437011719
      ],
      "text": "available LPAs (Genotype MTBDR and MTBDR , Hain Lifescience) were identified. sl  plus",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        386.08489990234375,
        527.0892944335938,
        399.22991943359375
      ],
      "text": "The Genoscholar PZA LPA was developed for use with the Nipro automated MultiBlot; however,",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.951894760131836,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        401.56549072265625,
        526.9286499023438,
        414.72991943359375
      ],
      "text": "12 a recent unpublished trial  demonstrated that the Twincubator by Hain Lifescience could be",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        417.08489990234375,
        526.9022216796875,
        430.22991943359375
      ],
      "text": "used successfully with this LPA. This finding could make it easier to implement the Genoscholar",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.976876258850098,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        432.58489990234375,
        461.315185546875,
        445.72991943359375
      ],
      "text": "PZA LPA in selected settings where Hain Lifescience equipment is already in use.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        456.77581787109375,
        306.6951599121094,
        469.65679931640625
      ],
      "text": "How large are the resource requirements (costs)?",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-LtIt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        480.5928039550781,
        526.9918212890625,
        493.7378234863281
      ],
      "text": "No direct evidence from published studies was found regarding the total resources required.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        496.0928039550781,
        524.4071044921875,
        509.2378234863281
      ],
      "text": "Resource requirements will include the purchase of test kits (Genoscholar PZA LPA: US$ 16/",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        511.5927734375,
        526.9613037109375,
        524.73779296875
      ],
      "text": "test kit consumables only), and the equipment, which is available for US$ 14 000. Operational",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        527.0927734375,
        527.003173828125,
        540.23779296875
      ],
      "text": "costs are frequently several times greater than test kit costs (and will vary across settings), but",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        542.5927734375,
        526.585693359375,
        555.73779296875
      ],
      "text": "are not accounted for usually. Nipro hopes that further reductions in test costs can be achieved",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.979881286621094,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        558.0927734375,
        379.7857666015625,
        571.23779296875
      ],
      "text": "when the Genoscholar PZA-TB II product is distributed globally.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        582.0966796875,
        526.92431640625,
        595.24169921875
      ],
      "text": "Unit test costs for the Genotype MTBDR  and MTBDR  ranged from US$ 23.46 to US$ 108.70  sl plus",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.94878101348877,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        597.5966796875,
        526.8956909179688,
        610.74169921875
      ],
      "text": ", with higher unit test costs in countries such as China and South Africa, largely driven by  (14–15)",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.961181640625,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        613.0966796875,
        527.1224975585938,
        626.24169921875
      ],
      "text": "higher staff wages and operational costs. Extrapolations from unit test costs using different LPAs",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.94486141204834,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        628.5966796875,
        526.9920043945312,
        641.74169921875
      ],
      "text": "should be done with caution, and they are not intended to be directly transferrable estimates.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        644.0966796875,
        526.9646606445312,
        657.24169921875
      ],
      "text": "Nevertheless, these indirect data do suggest that the total unit test cost of the Genoscholar",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        659.5966796875,
        485.54962158203125,
        672.74169921875
      ],
      "text": "PZA-TB II is likely several-fold higher than the unit test kit consumable cost of US$ 16.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        683.6005859375,
        527.2971801757812,
        696.74560546875
      ],
      "text": "Total costs will vary, depending on testing volume, numbers eligible for testing and prevalence",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.981584548950195,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        699.1005859375,
        527.0140380859375,
        712.24560546875
      ],
      "text": "of pyrazinamide resistance in the population. The impact on the budget will depend on the",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        714.6005859375,
        484.6139831542969,
        727.74560546875
      ],
      "text": "current standard of care, diagnostic and care pathways, and associated resource use.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        763.3696899414062,
        456.9263610839844,
        772.9437866210938
      ],
      "text": "12\t Leen Rigouts: Validation study of Genoscholar PZA LPA in three Supranational TB Reference Laboratories.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        40.76240158081055,
        802.0169067382812,
        138.45811462402344,
        811.576904296875
      ],
      "text": "96 WHO consolidated",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        138.4571075439453,
        802.0169067382812,
        177.0811309814453,
        811.576904296875
      ],
      "text": "guidelines",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        177.0803985595703,
        802.0169067382812,
        288.38323974609375,
        811.576904296875
      ],
      "text": "on tuberculosis: Fourth edition",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    }
  ]
}